---
import { iconSrcSet, withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<section class="widget-panel pricing-widget reveal" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading">
  <div class="widget-heading"><div><span class="widget-kicker">05 / KEEPING IT CLEAR</span><h2 id="pricing-heading">Pricing</h2></div><span class="widget-heading-note">TAILORED TO YOUR PROJECT</span></div>
  <div class="pricing-grid"><div><h3>Clear from the start.</h3><p>Affordable starter pricing, based on the scope of each project. I’ll discuss the requirements first and provide a clear quote before work begins.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Discuss your project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="pricing-note"><span class="info-icon" aria-hidden="true"><img src={withBase("images/ai/spark.webp")} srcset={iconSrcSet("spark")} sizes="(max-width: 600px) 45px, 72px" width="192" height="192" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" /></span><div><strong>Third-party costs</strong><p>Domain names, hosting, paid templates, and other third-party costs are separate unless explicitly included in the agreed quote.</p></div></div></div>
</section>
